Scope note
---------------------------------------------------------------------------

The MIT licence above covers the SOFTWARE in this repository:

    instrument/*.py

The measurement RESULTS are licensed separately, under CC BY 4.0 -- see
LICENSE-CC-BY-4.0.txt:

    instrument/gm1_report.json
    instrument/gm1_vq_report.json
    instrument/gm1_vq_run.log

NOT REDISTRIBUTED HERE: the aMUSEd-256 VQ codebook that GATE GM1-VQ calibrates
against. It is a slice of the weights of `amused/amused-256`, released under
the CreativeML Open RAIL++-M licence, whose use restrictions would otherwise
attach to this entire archive. `instrument/fetch_codebook.py` downloads it from
the Hugging Face Hub on demand, under that model's own terms, and verifies the
checksum of the exact table used for the published run.
